  "title": "Pre game",
  "background": "room-light",
  "note": "The black intro of about 3 s in the silent pre game (#213): it shows when the own side arrives, names it and its goal (and, for a human, the other humans), plays one sound per side, and needs no input. Nobody hears anybody and no text says so. Then the round fades in. No mic, no other HUD while it shows. The target page pages/suit-final, frame 4 (the role reveal, loud), every length x 1.5. Open: how the trip from the spaceship lobby maps onto Countdown, Loading and Pregame.",
  "states": [
    { "id": "alien", "label": "Прибулець", "note": "An alien's intro (the target's frame 4, the mint band)." },
    { "id": "human", "label": "Людина", "note": "A human's intro (the target's frame 4b): the danger band and title, and the other humans under the goal with their body colours (humans know each other, decided 2026-10-20)." },
    { "id": "after", "label": "Потім: раунд", "note": "The round fading in: Night fades from alpha 1 to 0 over 0.4 s (a cut under reduced motion) over the round HUD, s7 at the round's first second." }
  ],
